{"availability":"available","full":"Eesterlein/gunnison-land-attributes-demo","name":"gunnison-land-attributes-demo","description":"Independent research dashboard: interactive map and review tool for land attributes on Gunnison County, CO parcels, built from public assessor data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T01:01:20Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:32:24Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eesterlein.github.io/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/","topics":["automation","dashboard","data-pipeline","gis","github-actions","maplibre","property-assessment","python"],"demo":"https://eesterlein.github.io/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:33.613Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:33.613Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:33.613Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:21:17.300Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T09:23:33.613Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Independent research project. This dashboard is an independent research project built from publicly available Gunnison County, Colorado assessor data downloads and GIS parcel data. It is not an official product of the Gunnison County Assessor's Office or Gunnison County, is not a system of record, and may contain errors or out-of-date information. Always verify against official county records.","An interactive map and review tool for exploring land attributes on every parcel in Gunnison County. It is designed to help appraisers find accounts that are missing land attributes or carry attributes that don't match the properties around them."],"features":["Every tax parcel in the county (about 17,500 shapes covering about 21,000 accounts; stacked condo units share one shape).","Pick any land attribute (Land Type, Views, Unique Characteristics, Site Access, Electricity, Sewer, Water, LEA, Easements, Deed Restrictions, Mining District, …) and a sub-attribute, and matching parcels light up.","Flip through values with ▲ ▼ or the keyboard (↑ ↓ or J K). Each attribute also lists No value recorded and No land record.","Search by account, parcel number, address, subdivision or area.","Filter by account type and area. Switch between light, aerial and topo basemaps."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Eesterlein/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c5fd29c6afddb285fcf5a7244aadc40f92ee322e92df10a9ffa177361d6d1e2e","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:17.569Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T09:27:38.316Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Independent research project. This dashboard is an independent research project built from publicly available Gunnison County, Colorado assessor data downloads and GIS parcel data. It is not an official product of the Gunnison County Assessor's Office or Gunnison County, is not a system of record, and may contain errors or out-of-date information. Always verify against official county records.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Eesterlein/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c5fd29c6afddb285fcf5a7244aadc40f92ee322e92df10a9ffa177361d6d1e2e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Eesterlein/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T09:27:38.317Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T03:32:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Eesterlein/gunnison-land-attributes-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T09:27:38.317Z","hash":"c5fd29c6afddb285fcf5a7244aadc40f92ee322e92df10a9ffa177361d6d1e2e","originalBytes":6083,"storedBytes":6083,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","land","parcel","attributes","county","accounts","gunnison","build","downloads","account","attribute","type","values","map","review","scripts","shapes","site","xlsx","assessor","click","dashboard","github","python","about","acc